## New step 3 for the closing chain:

3. **Diff-based proof.** Compare claimed deliverables vs files actually changed. Run
   `git diff --name-only <base>` against the milestone base. For every work point in
   spec.html that claims completion, verify at least one file in its scope was modified.
   If a work point claims done but no files changed, flag it UNVERIFIED and report to
   the human. This catches the #1 trust problem: the agent said "done" but nothing moved.
   This runs BEFORE ai-verify because it checks the physical delta, not the requirements.

